{"product_id":"freedom-is-liberating-your-boundless-potential","title":"Freedom Is: Liberating your boundless potential","description":"\u003cp\u003eFreedom to live, love and succeed on your own terms comes from learning how to trust that grace will provide for you. This grace is to be found within ourselves and encompasses peace of mind, an ability to be fully present in the moment, and an awareness of the power and possibilities present in the infinite.Bestselling author Brandon Bays leads you on this challenging journey with daily meditations and contemplations to draw you ever deeper into an awareness of this awesome power. As your awareness grows, your own wisdom will reveal itself and you will be able to live in the deep peace of freedom.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 155 x 234\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Brandon Bays\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780340921005\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 272\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45387097768089,"sku":"3RG9780340921005","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/682317fbe5431_Freedom_Is-_Liberating_your_boundless_potential_Brandon_Bays.jpg?v=1747151057","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/freedom-is-liberating-your-boundless-potential","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}